<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Somague, A.Silva resume trade-dealers.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Somague, A.Silva resume trade-dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) has approved a resumption of trade in shares of construction firms Somague and A.Silva e Silva on Lisbon bourse, dealers said.</p>
<p>Trade in the shares of the two companies was suspended on Wednesday before the two firms announced that they had held conversations about a possible exchange of shares.</p>
<p>Lisbon bourse spokesmen were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
